{
  "dom_id": "step-629577",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Reading Argmax and Argmin From a Graph",
  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14221505/assets/eb6079ac70816cd56061b8b353cc734176eed1698c50376a2e7a34c40f582a89.png)\n\nLet $S=\\{0,1,2,3,4\\}.$ The graph above shows the value of $f(x)$ for each $x \\in S.$ Use the graph to compute\n\n$$\n\\max_{x \\in S} f(x),\\qquad \\arg\\max_{x \\in S} f(x),\\qquad \\min_{x \\in S} f(x),\\qquad \\arg\\min_{x \\in S} f(x).\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "Recall that \n\n- $\\max\\limits_{x \\in S} f(x)$ is the maximum output value, while\n\n- $\\arg\\max\\limits_{x \\in S} f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that maximum output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- $\\min\\limits_{x \\in S} f(x)$ is the minimum output value, while\n\n- $\\arg\\min\\limits_{x \\in S} f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that minimum output occurs.\n\nFrom the graph, the highest point has $y$-coordinate $5,$ and it occurs at $x=1.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\max_{x \\in S} f(x)=\\bbox[4pt,border: 1px solid lightgray]{5}\n\\qquad \\textrm{and} \\qquad\n\\arg\\max_{x \\in S} f(x)=\\bbox[4pt,border: 1px solid lightgray]{1}.\n$$\n\nThe lowest point has $y$-coordinate $0,$ and it occurs at $x=4.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\min_{x \\in S} f(x)=\\bbox[4pt,border: 1px solid lightgray]{0}\n\\qquad \\textrm{and} \\qquad\n\\arg\\min_{x \\in S} f(x)=\\bbox[4pt,border: 1px solid lightgray]{4}.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-629577\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"629577\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"22130\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-629577\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-7\">Reading Argmax and Argmin From a Graph</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"629577\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <!-- tikz --><style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n           